{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10413","headline":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 九 · 高适","name":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝从北岸来，泊船南河浒。\n试共野人言，深觉农夫苦。\n去秋虽薄熟，今夏犹未雨。\n耕耘日勤劳，租税兼舃卤。\n园蔬空寥落，产业不足数。\n尚有献芹心，无因见明主。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}